--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.payroll_periods.wages_cost IS 'Regular + overtime + commission — the figure Crew & Labor reports as labour cost (Ben, 2026-08-20). Excludes holiday, vacation/sick, bonus, tips and reimbursements.';


